Recommends: pkexec
Description: Syncro/RepairShopr AutoPrintr client for Linux (CUPS)
 Native Linux replacement for the deprecated AutoPrinter/AutoPrintr
 desktop app used by RepairShopr and SyncroMSP: documents generated in
 your account (tickets, invoices, receipts, labels, intake forms) print
 on the shop's CUPS printers within seconds.
 .
 Ships a hardened systemd daemon (Pusher websocket listener with REST
 polling fallback, PDF fetch, CUPS submission, SQLite job history) and
 an optional GTK3 tray applet for status, history and settings.
